ver_compensation 3.60). The anti-farming check does not trip and requires both limbs: no_show_terminations_30d is 2 (below the 4 required) and 2 divided by 92 completed trips is 0.022 (below the 0.08 required), so compensation is paid. Under POL-GEN-03 the ruling is DRIVER_COMPENSATION, with amount_sgd mirroring the driver compensation at SGD 3.60; the rider's SGD 4.50 charge stands (payment_status CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd 0.00). The monetary effect of SGD 3.60 is below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold and is executed automatically."
